    title: "llvm-ir: a `declare` of a function overwrites the `define` of the same name in the bare-name table, so a cross-file call binds to the declaration when the declaring file is indexed last"  # 5174
    status: todo_hard  # 5174
    priority: 3  # 5174
    parent:  # 5174
    tags:  # 5174
    - llvm_ir  # 5174
